**Question:** Encounters.ParentEncounterID references Encounters.EncounterID. Try to point encounter 2 to a parent that does not exist, and try to point encounter 2 to itself.

```sql
BEGIN TRY
    UPDATE healthcare.Encounters SET ParentEncounterID = 99999 WHERE EncounterID = 2;
END TRY
BEGIN CATCH
    SELECT 'Missing parent' AS Test, ERROR_NUMBER() AS ErrorNo;
END CATCH;

BEGIN TRY
    UPDATE healthcare.Encounters SET ParentEncounterID = 2 WHERE EncounterID = 2;
END TRY
